stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> StaticValidation: Synthesized Test Code
    
    StaticValidation --> REJECTED: Unsafe Path / Protected File / Disallowed Tokens
    StaticValidation --> UNVERIFIED: Syntax Error (AST parse / Delimiter mismatch)
    StaticValidation --> SandboxProvisioning: Syntax & Path Valid
    
    SandboxProvisioning --> EXECUTION_ERROR: Workspace Provisioning / Disk Quota Failure
    SandboxProvisioning --> BaselineCoverage: Workspace Ready
    
    BaselineCoverage --> StabilityExecution: Baseline Recorded
    StabilityExecution --> UNVERIFIED: Execution Failed (<= 1/3 Passed)
    StabilityExecution --> UNVERIFIED: Flakiness Detected (2/3 Passed - UNSTABLE)
    StabilityExecution --> PostGenCoverage: All 3 Runs Passed (3/3 - STABLE)
    
    PostGenCoverage --> UNVERIFIED: 0% Coverage Gain (No attributed lines)
    PostGenCoverage --> VERIFIED: Coverage Attributed (Gain > 0% or New Lines)
    
    VERIFIED --> WorkspaceCleanup: Finally Block
    UNVERIFIED --> WorkspaceCleanup: Finally Block
    REJECTED --> WorkspaceCleanup: Finally Block
    EXECUTION_ERROR --> WorkspaceCleanup: Finally Block
    
    WorkspaceCleanup --> [*]: Return TestGenerationResult
